
== Per-mate profile preserves all three axes ==
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate demo
claude
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate-model demo
pinned-model
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate-effort demo
medium
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate other
codex
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate-model other
default-model

== Invalid duplicate override refuses even an unrelated mate ==
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate other
error: config/secondmate-harness line 3: duplicate 'mate demo:' override (already set on line 2)
exit=1
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate-model other
error: config/secondmate-harness line 3: duplicate 'mate demo:' override (already set on line 2)
exit=1
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate-effort other
error: config/secondmate-harness line 3: duplicate 'mate demo:' override (already set on line 2)
exit=1

