== Genuine missing pin retains crew fallback and empty optional axes ==
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate demo
codex
$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate-model demo

$ bin/fm-harness.sh secondmate-effort demo


== Read-only capacity counts work separately from secondmates ==
$ bin/fm-capacity.sh
capacity: free_lanes=unknown reason=no-target lanes=2 target=none secondmates=1 load1=5.88 cores=14 mem_free_pct=48 disk_free_mb=69657
Lanes: 2 running, no target set (config/lane-capacity absent).
Secondmates: 1 (hold no lane).
Host: load 5.88 on 14 cores, memory free 48%, disk free 69657 MB.
$ bin/fm-capacity.sh (target=4)
capacity: free_lanes=2 reason=ok lanes=2 target=4 secondmates=1 load1=5.88 cores=14 mem_free_pct=48 disk_free_mb=69657
Lanes: 2 running of 4 target, 2 open.
Secondmates: 1 (hold no lane).
Host: load 5.88 on 14 cores, memory free 48%, disk free 69657 MB.

== Invalid capacity is refused, never guessed ==
$ bin/fm-capacity.sh
capacity: free_lanes=unknown reason=invalid-target lanes=2 target=invalid secondmates=1 load1=5.88 cores=14 mem_free_pct=48 disk_free_mb=69657
Lanes: 2 running, target unreadable (config/lane-capacity must hold one non-negative integer).
Secondmates: 1 (hold no lane).
Host: load 5.88 on 14 cores, memory free 48%, disk free 69657 MB.
fm-capacity: config/lane-capacity must hold one non-negative integer
exit=1

All direct CLI assertions satisfied; disposable home removed on exit.
